# Cloudflare form configuration

The contact form uses Cloudflare Turnstile and a Worker API route at `/api/contact`.

## Required Worker secrets

Set these in the Cloudflare dashboard or with Wrangler:

```bash
npx wrangler secret put TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY
npx wrangler secret put CONTACT_TO
```

## Variables in `wrangler.jsonc`

- `TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY` — public Turnstile site key (also set `PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY` at build time if you change it)
- `CONTACT_FROM` — sender address on a domain configured for Mailchannels/Email Routing
- `CONTACT_TO` — destination inbox for form submissions (can also be set as a secret)

## Local build env

```bash
PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=your_site_key npm run build
```

## Test Turnstile keys (development only)

- Site key: `1x00000000000000000000AA`
- Secret key: `1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA`
